   {
    "proposal_id": "2",
    "content": {
     "@type": "/cosmos.gov.v1beta1.TextProposal",
     "title": "4 Billion PURSE Airdrop to PUNDIX Holders on Upbit",
     "description": "Background:\n\nUpbit won the voting competition on Twitter against nine other centralized exchanges with the highest PUNDIX trading volume. The PURSE airdrop final decision will be determined by the governance voting. \n\nThe team proposed Upbit as the airdrop recipient for several reasons:\n\n- Upbit has consistently had the largest trading volume for the past few years.\n- Previously, Upbit did not receive the PURSE airdrop.\n- Upbit is one of the largest holders of PUNDIX tokens, meaning that the majority of PUNDIX holders are trading and holding tokens on Upbit. https://etherscan.io/token/0x0fd10b9899882a6f2fcb5c371e17e70fdee00c38?a=0x2bc8e0130319b206aace6f41e28fd0cb3c2a2960\n\nOnce the proposal passed the governance voting, Pundi X team will notify Upbit and the PUNDIX snapshot will kick start after the exchange confirmed the airdrop.\n\nProposal Medium Link: https://medium.com/pursetoken/purse-airdrop-for-pundix-holders-and-erc-20-support-ef8bd06addcf"
    },
