   {
    "proposal_id": "3",
    "content": {
     "@type": "/cosmos.gov.v1beta1.TextProposal",
     "title": "Burn 10 Billion PURSE token BEP20 in support of PURSE ERC404 community development",
     "description": "PURSE has announced the introduction of ERC-404 for its development, marking a significant leap forward in the evolution of web3 loyalty rewards. In alignment with our commitment to the community and the future development of PURSE ERC404, the team proposes a burn of 10 billion BEP20 PURSE tokens (13.6% of the total supply). \n\nThis innovative token standard, ERC404, ingeniously merges the properties of ERC20 fungible tokens and ERC721 non-fungible tokens (NFTs), creating a new class of assets that are both fungible and non-fungible depending on their state. By incorporating elements of both, PURSE ERC404 tokens offer unparalleled versatility and utility, catering to a wide range of use cases within the decentralized finance (DeFi) ecosystem.\n\nThis strategic token burn of BEP20 tokens and the adoption of ERC404 tokens align perfectly with our dedication to project growth and community involvement. This action potentially increases the utility of PURSE tokens as well as reduces the total supply. \n\nWe invite our community to engage in the upcoming vote on this proposal and join us as we shape the future of PURSE within the ERC404 framework. Stay tuned for further updates as we continue to innovate and push the boundaries of what is possible with digital assets."
    },
