   {
    "proposal_id": "6",
    "content": {
     "@type": "/cosmos.gov.v1beta1.TextProposal",
     "title": "$PURSE Market-Making Initiative from Kronos Research",
     "description": "This proposal aims to improve $PURSE liquidity on centralized exchanges. Market makers provide buy/sell orders on either side of the midpoint, allowing users on exchanges to buy, sell, and trade the token more efficiently, giving greater confidence in the asset. \n\nIn order to provide ample liquidity, Kronos Research is requesting a loan of 800,000,000 $PURSE tokens for 1 year. With this loan, Kronos Research can provide liquidity on 4 exchanges. Currently, the liquidity on these platforms is inconsistent.\n\nNote: Kronos Research does not attempt to influence market price in either direction.\n\nUpon the completion of the service period, Kronos can choose to return the PURSE tokens to PURSE treasury or purchase the tokens according to the following tranches (in stablecoins):\n\n* Tranch 1: 400,000,000 PURSE at [BMP*] x 1.5\n\n* Tranch 2: 400,000,000 PURSE at [BMP*] x 2\n\n*BMP: TWAP(time-weighted average price) 30-days commencing on the date of the Market Making Services begin\n\n**Kronos Background**\n\nKronos Research is a proprietary trading firm founded in 2018 that trades on average more than $5 billion USD per day across global platforms. In DeFi, Kronos Research is a leading designated market-maker on platforms like dYdX, Floor Protocol etc. Kronos Research also incubated WOO Network and Orderly Network.\n\n**Execution Plan**\n\nUpon approval of the governance proposal, the PURSE team will prepare to sign an agreement with Kronos Research to proceed with the initiative.\n"
    },
