   {
    "proposal_id": "7",
    "content": {
     "@type": "/cosmos.gov.v1beta1.TextProposal",
     "title": "Pundi AIFX:  Merge Pundi X Chain with f(x)Core",
     "description": "**Description:**\n\nThe purpose of this proposal is to merge Pundi X Chain and f(x)Core into Pundi AIFX. This merger aims to streamline our blockchain infrastructure and operations, allowing for seamless upgrades and enhanced functionality to embrace the multi-chain and Artificial Intelligence era. By combining the strengths of Pundi X Chain and f(x)Core, we can overcome current limitations and unlock new potential for innovation and growth.\n\n**The new Pundi AIFX ecosystem will offer several key features designed to enhance our capabilities and streamline our operations:**\n\n- **Chain Abstraction:**\nDevelopers can deploy once on Pundi AIFX, and the app will run without code changes on other EVM and Cosmos-compatible chains via omnichain channels. For example, a developer can launch a DEX on Pundi AIFX, which will then support Base, BSC, Osmosis, and more.\n\n- **AI-Focused DApps:**\nPundi AIFX will support AI-focused decentralized applications, including those that power Pundi Xs AI-powered Enterprise XPOS.\n\n**PUNDIX token utilities:**\n\n$PUNDIX tokenomics will remain unchanged.\n\nWhile Pundi AIFX network will utilize $AIFX as gas fee, $PUNDIX will maintain its critical role, providing a variety of utilities that enhance user experience and network functionality.\n\n**Execution Plan:**\n\nIf this proposal is approved, we will kick off the merger process, including further details about the Pundi X Chain retirement date and instructions for migrating assets to the new Pundi AIFX Chain.\n\nIf you have any questions about the Pundi X Chain merge, please join the discussion on the StarScan forum: https://forum.starscan.io/t/temperature-check-upgrade-f-x-core-and-rebrand-function-x-to-pundi-aifx/5966/123"
    },
    "status": "PROPOSAL_STATUS_PASSED",
